  "description": "Tool-argument and argument-error RULE TABLE for the five known catalogue tools - explicitly NOT a snapshot and NOT a successful query result. Each invalid case carries the COMPLETE literal semantic error envelope (ok,error -> code,message,parameter) frozen by the public contract; each valid control records acceptance only and never a successful payload. Rows reference existing valid synthetic snapshots by name (lookup.json, provider-extension.json); case ids are unique across both lists. No NaN or Infinity appears here: programmatic non-finite probes live in the test group only. Every expected envelope is a hand-written literal, never generated by a checker, validator or runtime.",
